  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IAEA support Ukraine 2025-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose is to help stabilize the nuclear safety and security situation in Ukraine and help decrease the risk of nuclear incidents or accidents, by funding IAEA assistance to Ukraine. The grant will support IAEA&#x2019;s Expert Missions at Ukraine&#x2019;s four nuclear power plants and Chornobyl, and allow further deliveries of nuclear safety and security related equipment to Ukraine throughout 2025 and 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
